006900 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
007000 77  COMPANY-SAVE                 PIC X(3)  VALUE SPACES.
007100 77  PO-DELETE-MONTHS             PIC 9(2)  VALUE ZEROS.
007200 77  PO-HIST-REC-SIZE             PIC 9(4)  VALUE ZEROS.
007300 77  END-OF-DPODESC-ENTRIES       PIC X(1)  VALUE SPACES.
007400 77  END-OF-DPOITEM-ENTRIES       PIC X(1)  VALUE SPACES.
007500 77  END-OF-DRCVITEM-ENTRIES      PIC X(1)  VALUE SPACES.
007600 77  END-OF-DINVRCD-ENTRIES       PIC X(1)  VALUE SPACES.
007700 77  END-OF-DINVITM-ENTRIES       PIC X(1)  VALUE SPACES.
007800 77  END-OF-DINVACCT-ENTRIES      PIC X(1)  VALUE SPACES.
       77  END-OF-DRCVCORR-ENTRIES      PIC X(1)  VALUE SPACES.
007900 77  PO-DELETE-CTR                PIC 9(5)  VALUE ZEROS.
008100 77  PO-DELETE-NO                 PIC S9(5) VALUE ZEROS.
008200
       01  FILE-STATUS.
           05  FILE-STATUS-1            PIC X  VALUE "0".
           05  FILE-STATUS-2            PIC X  VALUE "0".

008300 01  BUILD-DPORECD-BUFFER.
008400     05  DPORECD-DATA             PIC X(252).
008500     05  DVENDOR-NAME             PIC X(44).
008600
008700
